   <div><p class="lp-kicker">Hear it. Practise it. Make the call.</p><h1>Cold call opener:<span>the first 15 seconds.</span></h1><p class="lp-intro">Hear a B2B cold call opener for a sales leader whose team may be missing target accounts.</p><p>Alex asks who makes the first call, then waits for the answer. This {{ lesson.label }} shows the opening and the next question in an illustrative conversation.</p><div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#copy-opener">Copy the opening lines ↓</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="#opener-transcript">Read the transcript</a></div></div>
